        title="How Much Food to Serve at a Party: Per-Guest Quantities",
        meta_title="How Much Food for a Party: Per-Guest Chart",
        description="How much food for a party, per guest: quantities for appetizers, sandwiches, pizza, cake, fruit and drinks at kids' birthdays and baby showers, with a chart.",
        keyword="how much food for a party",
